Dear all,

I'm working on an internet draft dealing with errata in RFC 4960. This docu=
ment is now
in working group last call and can be accessed via
https://tools.ietf.org/html/draft-ietf-tsvwg-rfc4960-errata-04

It would be really great if someone with insights in the Linux SCTP stack c=
ould review it
and provide comments on the IETF mailing list tsvwg@ietf.org.

That plan is to get an Informational RFC which describes the required chang=
es to RFC 4960
and then base an upcoming RFC4960bis document on this Informational RFC. Th=
is is basically
the same approach as we took when moving from RFC 2960 to RFC 4960. The err=
ata where
documented in RFC 4460.

Please let me know if you have any questions.

Thank you very much for your help in advance.

